# ============ SQLite / Turso journals (never commit lock files) ============
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.db-journal
*.sqlite-wal
*.sqlite-shm
*.sqlite-journal

# NOTE: db/sih-projdb.db (pre-ingested corpus) IS tracked intentionally so the
# demo runs without re-ingesting. Rebuild it any time via POST /api/ingest.
# NOTE: raw_data/ (legal corpus PDFs) IS tracked intentionally — it is the
# evidence base every citation points to.

# ============ Office lock files (keep the real docs, ignore the clutter) ============
~$*
.~lock.*#

